OL,3,GNEWSABig Manx Feast made loss of more  
OL,4,Athan #85k                              
OL,6,FA food and drink festival held at      
OL,7,FNoble's Park in September made a loss  
OL,8,Fof more than #85,000, a report by      
OL,9,FBusiness Isle of Man has found.        
OL,11,FThe organisation, which ran the Big    
OL,12,FManx Feast, found the event brought in 
OL,13,Fjust over half of its #150,000 income  
OL,14,Ftarget. It said the rebranded festival 
OL,15,Fattracted 6,739 visitors, against a    
OL,16,Ftarget of between 10,000 and 12,000.   
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
