OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%,.*,$-, *.*  * %** %%* (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABig Manx Feast made loss of more  
OL,4,Athan #85k                              
OL,6,FOne trader said he made "hardly        
OL,7,Fanything" and blamed the decision to   
OL,8,Fchange the festival's name, adding:    
OL,9,F"The taxpayer has paid the price." The 
OL,10,Freport also cited poor weather and     
OL,11,Fexhibitor withdrawals as challenges    
OL,12,Ffacing the event.                      
OL,14,FThe Department for Enterprise said no  
OL,15,Fdecision had been made on whether the  
OL,16,Fevent would return in 2027.            
